  "summary": "Malicious code in real-router-utils (npm)",
  "details": "The package ships no code — only a package.json whose preinstall hook runs on install and sends the host's hostname, username, and current working directory to the webhook[.]site endpoint hxxps://webhook[.]site/e32d3b8a-a5df-40cc-ae60-7a8343b581e4 via an HTTP GET. This is an install-time host-recon beacon that exfiltrates system metadata to an external collection endpoint.",
